Cell["\<\
Multiple input and output components realize block-coded inputs and outputs.  \
The block position is determined by the order of appearance of input and \
output components. This reveals their respective sequence positions:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2060ff05-2e62-4402-bb5e-a13676564662"],

